 "words_heard": 212,
 "words": 214,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Peter stepped out on the water when the Master told him come",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But when he saw how strong the wind was, he was afraid",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And beginning to sink he cried out, Lord, save me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At once Jesus reached out his hand and caught hold of him",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have lain awake at midnight with a weight upon my chest",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Counting every what-if, finding no place for my rest",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But a voice cuts through the dark like a lantern on the shore",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And it speaks the word to me that it spoke so long before",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not fear, for I am with you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be dismayed, for I am your God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will strengthen you, I will surely help you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will uphold you with my righteous right hand",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For God did not give us a spirit of timidity",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But of power and love and self-control",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is no fear in love",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Perfect love drives out fear",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not fear, for I am with you",
   "heard": 8,
